    },
    {
      keywords: ['dress material', 'unstitched', 'suit'],
      response: `👗 Our <strong>Dress Materials</strong> collection includes exquisite unstitched fabrics in cotton, silk, linen, georgette, chanderi and more. Perfect for custom tailoring!<br><br>Want to inquire about specific fabrics? <a href="${WHATSAPP_LINK}?text=Hi, I'm interested in Dress Materials" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Message on WhatsApp →</a>`,
